construction.desc:
格鲁琼兹用水泵进行供水工作将由三个部分组成:
- 一种长方形的, 一层的建筑, 位于一个木桥上, 木桥架设在运河的正上方. 从这座楼下面流过的水将推动水轮;
- 位于运河岸边的建筑物, 建筑物下面有一口井, 里面有活塞式水泵, 由水轮驱动;
- 位于城墙第二线的水塔, 有管道和配水箱.

popup.string:
The game cannot access local storage - your browser has probably disabled cookies.
You can still play the game, however:
- You will not be able to continue the game where you left off if you close or refresh the page;
- You will not be able to store your settings
(language, volume);
- You will not be able to save your unlocked achievements;

It's highly recommended that you enable cookies before playing.
